[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0473","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0473.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11495","title":"GNU Binutils 链接器基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 2.45 版本的链接器组件在处理 elf64-x86-64.c 文件中的 elf_x86_64_relocate_section 函数时存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119）。攻击者可通过本地方式向目标系统提交特制的 ELF 文件触发该溢出，导致程序崩溃或潜在的内存破坏。该漏洞仅限本地利用，需要攻击者具有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 1.9，危害等级低。GNU Binutils 项目已发布补丁（commit 6b21c8b2ecfef5c95142cbc2c32f185cb1c26ab0）修复此问题，建议用户更新至修复版本。","severity":"LOW","score":1.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11495"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-08T20:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:30:34Z","remediation":"建议将 GNU Binutils 升级至 2.44 及以上版本（包含 commit 6b21c8b2ecfef5c95142cbc2c32f185cb1c26ab0 的修复）。SUSE 用户可安装 SUSE-SU-2025:4096-1 安全更新。对于无法立即升级的系统，避免在链接过程中使用 `-z gcs=implicit` 参数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/attachment.cgi?id=16393","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=33502","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=33502#c3","https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=binutils-gdb.git;h=6b21c8b2ecfef5c95142cbc2c32f185cb1c26ab0","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.327620","https://vuldb.com/?id.327620","https://vuldb.com/?submit.668290","https://www.gnu.org/","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11495.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11495.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11495.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11495.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-11495.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2025/C